# key D major  meter 3/4 (a bar is 12 sixteenths)
# Pinecrest, the snowy village: a slow music-box waltz. Struck-bell lead on the thin duty,
# a soft oom-pah-pah answer, a low held bass, one quiet hat on the last beat.
# The file is named zone_* so it sorts after winter.mml and the older song ids stay put.
# A  (1-8):   D  Bm G  A  | D  Bm Em A
# B  (9-16):  G  D/F+ Em Bm | G  D  Em A    (flowing 8th arps under the bells)
# A' (17-24): D  Bm G  A  | G  D  Em A7   (the A7 bar falls back onto bar 1)
